nput\n        on an issue, and documenting the design decisions that have gone into\n        Docutils and the reStructuredText format.\n    <paragraph>\n        For details see \n        <reference name=\"Docutils EP Purpose and Guidelines\" refuri=\"ep-001.html\">\n            Docutils EP Purpose and Guidelines\n        .\n        The \n        <reference name=\"template file\" refuri=\"ep-template.rst\">\n            template file\n        <target ids=\"template-file\" names=\"template\\ file\" refuri=\"ep-template.rst\">\n         can be used as\n        starting point for new enhancement proposals.\n    <section ids=\"index\" names=\"index\">\n        <title>\n            Index\n        <table>\n            <tgroup cols=\"3\">\n                <colspec colwidth=\"3\">\n                <colspec colwidth=\"57\">\n                <colspec colwidth=\"11\">\n                <thead>\n                    <row>\n                        <entry>\n                            <paragraph>\n                                #\n                        <entry>\n                            <paragraph>\n                                Title\n                        <entry>\n                            <paragraph>\n                                Status\n                <tbody>\n                    <row>\n                        <entry>\n                            <paragraph>\n                                001\n                        <entry>\n                            <paragraph>\n                                <reference name=\"Docutils EP Purpose and Guidelines\" refuri=\"ep-001.html\">\n                                    Docutils EP Purpose and Guidelines\n                                <target ids=\"docutils-ep-purpose-and-guidelines\" names=\"docutils\\ ep\\ purpose\\ and\\ guidelines\" refuri=\"ep-001.html\">\n                        <entry>\n                            <paragraph>\n                                Draft\n                    <row>\n                    